sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Backend as Backend Process
    participant SharedMem as Shared Memory
    participant WAL as WAL Buffer
    
    Note over Client,WAL: Two-Phase Commit with SSI
    
    Client->>Backend: BEGIN
    Client->>Backend: SELECT (acquire locks)
    Backend->>SharedMem: Create predicate locks
    
    Client->>Backend: PREPARE TRANSACTION 'xid'
    activate Backend
        Backend->>Backend: AtPrepare_PredicateLocks()
        Note over Backend: Serialize locks to state file
        
        Backend->>WAL: Write XLOG_XACT_PREPARE
        Backend->>WAL: Write predicate lock records
        
        Backend->>SharedMem: Mark as PREPARED
        deactivate Backend
    
    Note over Client,SharedMem: Two-phase window<br/>Predicate locks preserved
    
    Client->>Backend: COMMIT PREPARED 'xid'
    activate Backend
        Backend->>Backend: PreCommit_CheckForSerializationFailure()
        
        alt Dangerous Structure Found
            Backend->>Client: ERROR: serialization_failure
            Note over Backend: Transaction marked DOOMED
        else No Danger
            Backend->>SharedMem: Record commitSeqNo
            Backend->>WAL: Write XLOG_XACT_COMMIT
            
            Backend->>SharedMem: Move to FinishedList
            Backend->>Backend: ReleasePredicateLocks()
        end
        deactivate Backend
    
    Client->>Backend: Done
